<Track #fix-tui-effective-model-priority version="1" apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "completed" description = "修复 terminal TUI 模型 dialog 选择不按优先级生效，以及 input 底部状态条显示旧 provider/model 的问题。" commit_mode = "manual" created_at = "2026-06-02T16:26:33Z" updated_at = "2026-06-02T16:57:57Z" } (
  <Ports { scope = "track" } [
    <MaterialBundle { role = "input" name = "behavior-deltas" domain = "behavior" path = "vfs://./behavior_deltas/" }>
    <MaterialBundle { role = "output" name = "docs" domain = "doc" path = "vfs://@/docs/" }>
    <MaterialBundle { role = "output" name = "behavior" domain = "codument" path = "vfs://@/codument/behaviors/" }>
  ]>
  <TaskSpace #space_fix-tui-effective-model-priority { name = "fix-tui-effective-model-priority" } (
    <SubNodes [
      <TaskGroup #P1 { name = "建模与解析器" status = "DONE" order = 0 } (
        <Description ?01M05F1PF9B58ABD0MYJKTAR4B>
        引入 source-aware effective model 数据模型和优先级解析。
        </?01M05F1PF9B58ABD0MYJKTAR4B>
        <SubNodes [
          <Task { id = "T1.1" name = "定义模型来源类型和候选结构" status = "DONE" order = 0 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PF9B58ABD0MYJKTAR4C>
            在 TUI selection/data 层定义 TuiModelSource、候选值和 effective model 输出，避免 provider/model 继续无来源拍平。
            </?01M05F1PF9B58ABD0MYJKTAR4C>
          )>
          <Task { id = "T1.2" name = "实现 effective model resolver" status = "DONE" order = 1 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PF9B58ABD0MYJKTAR4D>
            按 user-explicit、cli-arg、agent-memory、agent-default、runtime-config、recent、provider-default 顺序解析第一个有效候选。
            </?01M05F1PF9B58ABD0MYJKTAR4D>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
      <TaskGroup #P2 { name = "TUI 状态接线" status = "DONE" order = 1 } (
        <Description ?01M05F1PF9B58ABD0MYJKTAR4E>
        让 graph/local context/model dialog 使用统一的 effective model 投影。
        </?01M05F1PF9B58ABD0MYJKTAR4E>
        <SubNodes [
          <Task { id = "T2.1" name = "改造 graph selection projection" status = "DONE" order = 0 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PF9B58ABD0MYJKTAR4F>
            替换依赖 default selection 的 runtime history 覆盖启发式，改为 source-aware 候选投影。
            </?01M05F1PF9B58ABD0MYJKTAR4F>
          )>
          <Task { id = "T2.2" name = "改造 local context 模型解析" status = "DONE" order = 1 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PF9B58ABD0MYJKTAR4G>
            避免 agent 默认同步因为 provider/model-only 变化覆盖人工选择；agent 切换时才重新收集 agent 候选。
            </?01M05F1PF9B58ABD0MYJKTAR4G>
          )>
          <Task { id = "T2.3" name = "接入模型 dialog 人工选择" status = "DONE" order = 2 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PF9B58ABD0MYJKTAR4H>
            模型 dialog 选择写入 user-explicit 来源，并立即影响提交链路和状态条。
            </?01M05F1PF9B58ABD0MYJKTAR4H>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
      <TaskGroup #P3 { name = "显示与验证" status = "DONE" order = 2 } (
        <Description ?01M05F1PF9B58ABD0MYJKTAR4J>
        让状态条显示有效模型，并补齐回归测试。
        </?01M05F1PF9B58ABD0MYJKTAR4J>
        <SubNodes [
          <Task { id = "T3.1" name = "更新 composer 状态条显示" status = "DONE" order = 0 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PF9B58ABD0MYJKTAR4K>
            input 底部状态条使用 effective model resolver 输出格式化 provider/model。
            </?01M05F1PF9B58ABD0MYJKTAR4K>
          )>
          <Task { id = "T3.2" name = "补充优先级与投影测试" status = "DONE" order = 1 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PF9B58ABD0MYJKTAR4M>
            覆盖人工选择优先、启动参数优先于配置、agent-memory 优先于 agent-default、runtime history 不覆盖显式来源。
            </?01M05F1PF9B58ABD0MYJKTAR4M>
          )>
          <Task { id = "T3.3" name = "运行目标测试" status = "DONE" order = 2 priority = "P1" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PF9B58ABD0MYJKTAR4N>
            运行 TUI graph、local runtime facade 和 slash/model selection 相关测试，确认非 prompt slash 行为不回归。
            </?01M05F1PF9B58ABD0MYJKTAR4N>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
      <TaskGroup #P4 { name = "VM actor active model 边界" status = "DONE" order = 3 } (
        <Description ?01M05F1PF9B58ABD0MYJKTAR4P>
        让 effective model 通过 cell VM signal 写入每个 actor 的 active model config，而不是作为 terminal turn 参数旁路 runtime。
        </?01M05F1PF9B58ABD0MYJKTAR4P>
        <SubNodes [
          <Task { id = "T4.1" name = "新增 actor active model control signal" status = "DONE" order = 0 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PF9B58ABD0MYJKTAR4Q>
            在 actor control mailbox 中增加 set_active_model_config，并提供 cell helper 应用该 control 到 actor.modelConfig。
            </?01M05F1PF9B58ABD0MYJKTAR4Q>
          )>
          <Task { id = "T4.2" name = "改造 terminal bridge 模型切换路径" status = "DONE" order = 1 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PF9B58ABD0MYJKTAR4R>
            移除 turn({ model }) 旁路，改为 setActorActiveModel 通过 ActorSurface facade 投递 control signal，并根据 actor.modelConfig 刷新 adapter。
            </?01M05F1PF9B58ABD0MYJKTAR4R>
          )>
          <Task { id = "T4.3" name = "接入 prompt 和 actor send" status = "DONE" order = 2 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PF9B58ABD0MYJKTAR4S>
            TUI prompt、slash command 和 actor surface send 在发送用户输入前先写入目标 actor 的 active model config。
            </?01M05F1PF9B58ABD0MYJKTAR4S>
          )>
          <Task { id = "T4.4" name = "补充 cell 与 TUI 测试" status = "DONE" order = 3 priority = "P1" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PF9B58ABD0MYJKTAR4T>
            覆盖 active model control 不吞其他 control，以及 local runtime prompt 会调用 actor active model 写入路径。
            </?01M05F1PF9B58ABD0MYJKTAR4T>
          )>
          <Task { id = "T4.5" name = "显式模型选择严格解析" status = "DONE" order = 4 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PF9B58ABD0MYJKTAR4V>
            显式选择 provider/model 时必须解析到配置目录中的已知条目；解析失败时向 TUI 返回 Runtime error，禁止静默 fallback 到旧 actor modelConfig。
            </?01M05F1PF9B58ABD0MYJKTAR4V>
          )>
          <Task { id = "T4.6" name = "保留 provider/model options" status = "DONE" order = 5 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PF9B58ABD0MYJKTAR4W>
            将 llm-provider.json 的 provider/model options 写入 ActorModelConfig，并在初始 adapter 创建与 actor active model 切换时传给 ProviderRuntimeAdapter。
            </?01M05F1PF9B58ABD0MYJKTAR4W>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
    ]>
  )>
  <Schedule>
)>
